# The site shows the screenshots from docs/img, which .github/workflows/pages.yml copies into
# the artifact. A link inside site/ would be committed and would break that copy, so a local
# preview assembles the same tree in /tmp instead (see site/README.md)
/site/docs/img

# Worktrees of Claude Code agents
.claude/worktrees/

